# Phase A.1 — The four `墨香【...】` directories at the repo root are
# the unmodified 2003-2010 source code + PlayDH resources + tutorial
# documents.  They are explicitly kept *outside* git tracking per
# AGENTS.md rule "原始源码（不动）"; the modern/ tree is the only
# commit target.
墨香【客户端+服务端+工具】/
墨香【教程】/
墨香【源码】/
墨香【源码配套资源】/

# Phase A.1 — `modern/third_party/googletest-src/` is a vendored copy
# of GoogleTest that we patched.
modern/third_party/googletest-src/

# Phase A.1 — `build_map_detected_encoding.json` is a per-build cache.
modern/scripts/build_map_detected_encoding.json

# Phase A.1 — session-ephemeral artifacts from old agent runs.
modern/docs/progress-video/
modern/scratch/progress_dashboard.html
modern/scratch/transfer_*/

# Phase 6 — alternate CMake build directories (kept as working trees
# but never tracked; they have machine-local state).
modern/build2/
modern/build_check/
modern/build_vs/
modern/test_quick.txt

# Phase 6 — scratch directory contains session-ephemeral analysis and
# build helpers.  Per AGENTS.md, scratch files belong to
# `modern/scratch/<date>-<topic>/` and are not tracked.
modern/scratch/

# Phase 6 — top-level scratch scripts (debug + build wrappers) are
# session-only and should never enter the repo.  Use scripts/ for
# anything that needs to persist.
/scratch_*.py
